Happy to officially welcome Johannes SANDBERG in the group as a postdoctoral researcher for 1.5 year. He will be working on linear models of machine-learning interaction potentials in collaboration with [Genevieve Dusson](https://gdusson.perso.math.cnrs.fr/) and funded by [AISSAI](https://aissai.cnrs.fr/en/).
